      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Every few seconds, Nocturne's next attack strikes surrounding enemies for bonus physical damage and heals himself. Nocturne's basic attacks reduce this cooldown.",
      "summary_zh": "每过数秒，魔腾的下次攻击就会对附近敌人造成额外物理伤害，并治疗自己。 魔腾的普通攻击会减少该技能的冷却时间。",
