      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Nocturne throws a shadow blade that deals damage, leaves a Dusk Trail, and causes champions to leave a Dusk Trail. While on the trail, Nocturne can move through units and has increased Move Speed and Attack Damage.",
      "summary_zh": "魔腾扔出一把暗影之刃，对敌人造成伤害并留下幽灵影径，并使受到伤害的敌方英雄也留下幽灵影径。在影径上时，魔腾无视任何碰撞体积，并且他的移动速度和攻击力也会得到提高。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308582:4026429"
      ]
    },
    {
