      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Nocturne empowers his blades, passively gaining Attack Speed. Activating Shroud of Darkness allows Nocturne to fade into the shadows, creating a magical barrier which blocks a single enemy ability and doubles his passive Attack Speed if successful.",
      "summary_zh": "魔腾强化他的刀刃，被动地提升他的攻击速度。主动激活此技能，将使魔腾融入黑影中，同时产生一个能够抵挡掉敌方单个技能的魔法护盾。若抵挡成功，则被动的攻速加成效果将提升至两倍。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308583:3948584"
      ]
    },
